{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11926","headline":"缆船苦风戏题四韵奉简郑十三判官 · 杜甫","name":"缆船苦风戏题四韵奉简郑十三判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚岸朔风疾，天寒鶬鸹呼。\n涨沙霾草树，舞雪渡江湖。\n吹帽时时落，维舟日日孤。\n因声置驿外，爲觅酒家垆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}